The files under goat-transformers/ are pack and model definition files of
goat-transformers (https://github.com/USAREUR-AF/goat-transformers), copied
unchanged from commit d57d36118edf296d1f610893025631f97d955ded (release
xf-pipe-v0.1.1). The runtime links the goat-transformers engine and its
goat-adapters-core and goat-adapters-std crates, built from the same commit.
goat-transformers is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; its
licence and notice are GOAT-TRANSFORMERS-LICENSE and GOAT-TRANSFORMERS-NOTICE
in this directory. The test vectors under tests/vectors take their input
messages from the vectors of the same commit.

The runtime also links the Rust crates named in Cargo.lock, each under its own
licence.
